{"4236610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Halls of the damned", "steam_appid": 4236610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Halls of the Damned</strong> is a hardcore multiplayer extraction dungeon crawler where survival is everything. Players enter a dark, labyrinthine dungeon, facing off against rival squads and deadly fantasy creatures. Each match is a high-stakes race to gather loot, outwit enemies, and escape before the dungeon seals shut. With limited resources, shifting zones, and the constant threat of death, every decision counts — and only those who survive keep what they’ve earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for intense short-session gameplay, the game blends competitive PvP with cooperative survival. Players who die lose all their gear, while successful extraction preserves hard-won items for future runs. Whether you're coordinating with teammates or clashing with others in brutal combat, <strong>Halls of the Damned</strong> delivers a relentless, risk-reward experience where strategy, skill, and timing determine your fate.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Halls of the Damned</strong> is a hardcore multiplayer extraction dungeon crawler where survival is everything. Players enter a dark, labyrinthine dungeon, facing off against rival squads and deadly fantasy creatures. Each match is a high-stakes race to gather loot, outwit enemies, and escape before the dungeon seals shut. With limited resources, shifting zones, and the constant threat of death, every decision counts — and only those who survive keep what they’ve earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for intense short-session gameplay, the game blends competitive PvP with cooperative survival. Players who die lose all their gear, while successful extraction preserves hard-won items for future runs. Whether you're